# 容器里的 sshd 只提供 SFTP：只有 files 账号能登录，只能传文件，不能开命令行，只看得到 /workspace。
Port 2222
HostKey /state/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers files
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthorizedKeysFile /state/sftp_authorized_keys
MaxAuthTries 3
LoginGraceTime 20
MaxStartups 5:50:20
UsePAM yes
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp

Match User files
    ChrootDirectory /srv/sftp
    ForceCommand internal-sftp -d /workspace
    AllowTcpForwarding no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
    PermitTTY no
